1
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:09,260
- So "tenured" means ajob for life?
- Yep.

2
00:00:09,496 --> 00:00:10,656
And you can't get fired...

3
00:00:10,831 --> 00:00:12,861
(Penny:)...even if you're bad at it?
- Mm, not really.

4
00:00:13,066 --> 00:00:16,836
(Penny:)Wow, sounds a lot like being a pretty
waitress at the Cheesecake Factory.

5
00:00:18,772 --> 00:00:21,102
(Sheldon:)While I disagree
with the premise of tenure...

6
00:00:21,341 --> 00:00:24,101
(Sheldon:)...if they gave it to me,
it wouldn't diminish my output.

7
00:00:24,344 --> 00:00:28,614
I'm like the sun. I can't turn this off.

8
00:00:30,617 --> 00:00:34,107
- Are Rajesh and Leonard competing as well?
- Mm-hm.

9
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:37,348
(Amy:)Do they know they don't stand a chance
because you're so great?

10
00:00:37,991 --> 00:00:39,251
(Sheldon:)Well put.

11
00:00:40,527 --> 00:00:43,687
(Sheldon:)I must say, I go back and forth
on this boyfriend-girlfriend thing...

12
00:00:43,897 --> 00:00:47,527
(Sheldon:)...but those moments when you worship me
really keep you in the running.

13
00:00:50,871 --> 00:00:54,141
It would be nice to have the income,
stop taking money from my parents.

14
00:00:54,374 --> 00:00:57,004
(Howard:)Money from family does come
with strings attached.

15
00:00:57,211 --> 00:00:58,871
(Raj:)You have no idea.

16
00:00:59,079 --> 00:01:06,029
(Raj:)They buy me a new BMW for my birthday,
but can I get seat warmers? No.

